label: Soil Polygon Shape
description: >-
  The same clipped segment with its geometry PARSED into declared structure.
  The node between this and SoilPolygonWkt is where an untrusted string from a
  federal API becomes data the membrane has actually checked -- every vertex
  range-validated, every coordinate labelled.
index: polygonId
fields:
  polygonId:
    type: utf8
    label: Polygon ID
    description: Stable key for this clipped segment
    nullable: false
    validations:
      minLength: 1
      maxLength: 100
  mukey:
    type: utf8
    label: Map Unit Key
    description: SSURGO map unit this segment belongs to
    nullable: false
    validations:
      minLength: 1
      maxLength: 30
  rings:
    many: Ring
